{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1097652-advice-on-a-antagonist-idea","id":1097652,"title":"Advice on a antagonist idea","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-27T18:39:18-07:00","id":1097652,"title":"Advice on a antagonist idea","content":"I came up with a titan cult and I want some advice on it. The basic idea is that they are a cult of university students and professors that have managed to infiltrate halls of academia and are spreading titanic corruption throughout the educational system. I want advice on how to make them threats to Scions and which titan would be the most fitting for this group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-27T19:37:28-07:00","id":1097668,"title":"","content":"Remember that in 2e not all Titans are antagonists. This group could just as easily be a radical cult of Djehuti before anything relating to the Titans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-27T19:49:10-07:00","id":1097669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1097652-advice-on-a-antagonist-idea?p=1097668#post1097668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remember that in 2e not all Titans are antagonists. This group could just as easily be a radical cult of Djehuti before anything relating to the Titans.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bGood point. I might go with a cult dedicated to Thoth that is infiltrating the academic system. I wonder what kind of damage the cultists can do to society and how they can be a danger to Scions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-27T19:52:23-07:00","id":1097671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1097652-advice-on-a-antagonist-idea#post1097652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I came up with a titan cult and I want some advice on it. The basic idea is that they are a cult of university students and professors that have managed to infiltrate halls of academia and are spreading titanic corruption throughout the educational system. I want advice on how to make them threats to Scions and which titan would be the most fitting for this group.</div> </div> </div> </div>Depending on if you are talking about First or Second Edition is fairly important as Atamajakki mentioned. In Second Edition, a Titan does not necessarily want to cause anything bad just due to being a Titan any more than particularly antagonistic Deities do. However, since the premise you mention here makes more sense in First Edition, I'll give advice based on that! If you want advice for Second Edition, we could try to give you some advice, but at best it would be a lot of guesswork.<br /> <br /> For First Edition, the first thing you want to figure out is what the goal of this Titan is, and this goal will narrow down what field of Academia it is tainting. For example, if the Earth Sciences department at my University went rogue in some veneration of... let's say Gaia, the Celtic Studies Department would probably never notice. So, to start with I would select a Titan directly related to whatever field you want to look into. Some random examples, Gaia for Earth Sciences, Cronus or Crom Cruach (real Crom Cruach, not Scion: Companion's version) for Agriculture Sciences, Okeanus or Lir for Oceanography, etc. If you want a general 'Knowledge' one, you <i>could</i> do Prometheus, but I would probably suggest Prometheus specifically for a Theology, Engeneering, or Arts Department based off the gifts he gives humanity.<br /> <br /> So, making them a threat to Scions. Again, this comes down to exactly what field they are focusing in. The Agriculture Scientists could create a crop killing plague, with the challenge not being themselves (they are still just frail mortals) but the fact they have created a global famine the Scions have to deal with. If you want a real, more physical challenge, maybe a Typhon Cult is breeding crazy sorts of animals for the Scions to fight. An Oceanography Cult could be trying to raise sea levels. My personal favorite idea would be a Cult to Bres or another similarly Law and Order focused Titan just dumping the entire weight of a legal system on the Scions to challenge them.<br /> <br /> If you want a method for which the corruption to spread, I'd suggest journals of some sort. The Academics are getting stuff published that contains Titanic ideas that are somehow more compelling than normal, and are creating a feedback loop within the discourse of the field. Academic A itterates Titanic Theory A, Academic B writes a paper critiquing it, Academic C, D, E, F, G all read it and write their own works on it, etc. <br /> <br /> If you have a specific department, or sort of challenge you want to give your PCs, I might be able to give more specific advice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}